{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type BeforeToolCallDecision = \n  | void\n  | undefined\n  | null\n  | {\n  args: unknown;\n  type: \"transformArgs\";\n}\n  | {\n  result: unknown;\n  type: \"skip\";\n}\n  | {\n  reason?: string;\n  type: \"abort\";\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L423","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:423"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Decision returned from onBeforeToolCall."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"undefined/void: continue with normal execution"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"{ type: 'transformArgs', args }: replace args used for execution"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"{ type: 'skip', result }: skip execution, use provided result"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"{ type: 'abort', reason }: abort the entire chat run"}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype BeforeToolCallDecision = \n  | void\n  | undefined\n  | null\n  | {\n  args: unknown;\n  type: \"transformArgs\";\n}\n  | {\n  result: unknown;\n  type: \"skip\";\n}\n  | {\n  reason?: string;\n  type: \"abort\";\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:423](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L423)\n\nDecision returned from onBeforeToolCall.\n- undefined/void: continue with normal execution\n- { type: 'transformArgs', args }: replace args used for execution\n- { type: 'skip', result }: skip execution, use provided result\n- { type: 'abort', reason }: abort the entire chat run\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: BeforeToolCallDecision\ntitle: BeforeToolCallDecision\n---\n\n```ts\ntype BeforeToolCallDecision = \n  | void\n  | undefined\n  | null\n  | {\n  args: unknown;\n  type: \"transformArgs\";\n}\n  | {\n  result: unknown;\n  type: \"skip\";\n}\n  | {\n  reason?: string;\n  type: \"abort\";\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts:423](https://github.com/TanStack/ai/blob/main/packages/ai/src/activities/chat/middleware/types.ts#L423)\n\nDecision returned from onBeforeToolCall.\n- undefined/void: continue with normal execution\n- { type: 'transformArgs', args }: replace args used for execution\n- { type: 'skip', result }: skip execution, use provided result\n- { type: 'abort', reason }: abort the entire chat run\n"}
